Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.61,0:00:03.74,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,Yuu, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:09.90,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,I can't believe every alarm clock in the \Nhouse broke on the day of his big test...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:12.70,Flashback,Akisada,0,0,0,,Yuu just bolted out of the house earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:13.74,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.99,0:00:26.23,Flashback,Guy E11,0,0,0,,S-Sorry! Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:31.77,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.65,0:00:35.11,Flashback,Guy E11,0,0,0,,You're not hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.11,0:00:36.39,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:39.59,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's all right. I'm used to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.37,0:00:49.36,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs16\fay.15\c&H927075&\3c&HF6F8F8&\4c&HF6F8F8&\move(71.333,74,216,74)}Hand-Washing\NWeek
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:44.23,Flashback,Nurse,0,0,0,,You were almost hit by a bike {\i1}again{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.23,0:00:45.46,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:47.25,Flashback,Nurse,0,0,0,,You really need to be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.25,0:00:48.88,Flashback,Nurse,0,0,0,,You'll get yourself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.87,0:00:53.66,Flashback,Nurse,0,0,0,,By the way, you have a\N field trip coming up, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.66,0:00:56.53,Flashback,Nurse,0,0,0,,I'll be going too, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:00:58.62,Flashback,Nurse,0,0,0,,Exciting, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.96,0:00:59.77,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.46,0:01:02.96,Flashback,PE Teacher,0,0,0,,Five-minute break!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.13,0:01:05.47,Flashback,Classmate1 E11,0,0,0,,Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.47,0:01:07.10,Flashback,Classmate1 E11,0,0,0,,Observing again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.10,0:01:09.68,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, since I got hurt the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.73,Flashback,Classmate2,0,0,0,,You got hurt {\i1}again?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.73,0:01:14.01,Flashback,Classmate1 E11,0,0,0,,Well, that's Izumi for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:18.47,Flashback,Classmate2 E11,0,0,0,,Hey, wanna group up \Nwith us for the field trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.19,0:01:24.28,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure? If I'm with you,\N bad things might happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:26.88,Flashback,Classmate2 E11,0,0,0,,C'mon, it's fine! Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.46,0:01:28.73,Flashback,Classmate2 E11,0,0,0,,Where should we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.73,0:01:30.28,Flashback,Classmate1 E11,0,0,0,,We can't miss that one place!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:31.57,Flashback,Classmate2 E11,0,0,0,,I hear ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.57,0:01:32.27,Flashback,Classmate2 E11,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:33.89,Flashback,Classmate1 E11,0,0,0,,The heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.89,0:01:35.04,Flashback,Classmate2 E11,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:37.36,Flashback,Woman,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:39.92,Flashback,Classmate2 E11,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.38,0:01:42.91,Flashback,Classmate2 E11,0,0,0,,A falling teddy bear? \NNever saw that coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.08,0:01:45.34,Flashback,Classmate2 E11,0,0,0,,I thought my neck was broken for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.34,0:01:47.01,Flashback,Classmate1 E11,0,0,0,,Man, that could've been bad. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.01,0:01:48.24,Flashback,Classmate2 E11,0,0,0,,That seriously hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:49.49,Flashback,Classmate1 E11,0,0,0,,Unreal...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.07,0:01:55.97,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,Yes. He isn't feeling well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.97,0:01:59.93,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,so I'd rather not send \Nhim on the field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:03.86,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,Okay. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.44,0:02:09.61,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Is my whole life just going \Nto be an endless loop of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:16.10,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,God, are things ever going \Nto get any better for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.56,0:02:23.62,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,If not, then please give me the strength \Nto endure all this pain and sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:31.11,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,If only a hero would appear before me...
