Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.84,0:04:07.89,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Why did you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:09.86,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,Got nothing else to do today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:12.78,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I didn't ask you to come shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.78,0:04:15.85,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,Hey, I drove you here. No griping.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:18.07,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I never asked you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:19.48,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,Aw, c'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.13,0:04:22.48,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,It's not so bad every now and then, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.50,0:04:25.61,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Stop treating me like a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:27.77,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,Well, you {\i1}are{\i0} still a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.77,0:04:28.54,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.54,0:04:30.11,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,Way to prove my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.31,0:04:33.94,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm going to look at clothes. \NWhat about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.94,0:04:37.46,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,I'm gonna head where I wanna. \NDrop me a line when you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.46,0:04:39.49,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You're not even staying...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.49,0:04:40.93,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,What? You sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.93,0:04:42.36,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You must be joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.36,0:04:43.84,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,Ow, harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.18,0:04:49.65,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Hmm... Should I go for cute or chic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.65,0:04:51.58,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Which would be better?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:58.64,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1)\fnArial\fs18\frz-5\pos(508,26.666)\3c&H43324C&\4c&HECB8EC&}So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:58.64,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1)\fnArial\fs18\frz5\3c&H472D33&\4c&HFAB8BD&\pos(137.333,35.333)}You're so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:02.20,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I can't decide!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:02.86,Main,Employee,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.07,0:05:07.73,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,With the cultural festival and all,\N we haven't had the chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.73,0:05:09.74,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,This'll be our first date in so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.74,0:05:15.12,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's been a while since we had \Ntime to talk with just us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:16.78,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yes, it has.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.78,0:05:20.01,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,With the cultural and athletic festivals,\N there was so much going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:23.37,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, plus I had that cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.37,0:05:25.26,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm just glad you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.26,0:05:28.19,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It made me happy when you \Ncame over with Inuzuka-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.19,0:05:31.75,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh? Er, d-did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:34.80,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go somewhere together again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.80,0:05:36.52,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Sure, I'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.30,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay, let's decide right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.30,0:05:38.98,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.98,0:05:42.36,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh, that's okay. We don't \Nneed to decide right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:44.78,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm happy to go anywhere with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.31,0:05:49.13,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,But... it's been so long since \Nit was just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.45,0:05:51.79,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I want to talk with you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.61,0:05:54.39,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Bad idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.39,0:05:55.60,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh? What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:57.63,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,This really is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.53,0:05:59.04,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\bord1\blur4\3c&H404142&\pos(322,285.333)}Her heart is pounding
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.31,0:06:00.95,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,So, where shall we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.60,0:06:04.88,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well, things like spas \Nare popular right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.88,0:06:08.54,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,A spa, huh? Sounds nice. \NThat would warm us right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.59,0:06:12.26,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, this amusement park \Ncommercial is really cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:13.53,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:15.52,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let me just... Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:18.52,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\fs14\frz9\an1\pos(122.667,299.334)\bord0\c&H797979&}"Off to Dreamland with the People You Love" Promo
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.76,0:06:32.27,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What do you think? Should we—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.27,0:06:33.16,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,We'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.10,0:06:35.72,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You're sure, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:38.28,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah. I'm sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.76,0:06:41.51,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were so \Ninterested in going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.51,0:06:43.05,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Uh, no, that's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.66,0:06:47.66,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,A date like the one in that commercial...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:50.17,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I can't mess this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:54.83,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I couldn't decide on anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:56.56,Main,Customer1,0,0,0,,Aw, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.56,0:06:58.91,Main,Customer1,0,0,0,,If you're free, you should \Ncome to karaoke with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.91,0:07:01.16,Main,Customer2,0,0,0,,You're really good-looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.05,0:07:03.70,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,Uh... er...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.70,0:07:06.07,Main,Customer1,0,0,0,,Aw, you're nervous! That's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.07,0:07:09.24,Main,Customer2,0,0,0,,I love it, I just love it! \NYou'll hang out with us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.02,0:07:11.95,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.11,0:07:13.05,Main,Customer1,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.05,0:07:14.19,Main,Customer2,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:17.43,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:21.73,Main,Customer1,0,0,0,,Well, damn. He had a cute girlfriend already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:23.21,Main,Customer2,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.85,0:07:25.20,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,So humiliating...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:28.14,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,My kid sister had to bail me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:31.39,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,The same one who used\N to need me to hold her hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.39,0:07:33.08,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,When was that, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.67,0:07:36.84,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Honestly, you're a lot shyer than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.15,0:07:40.65,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,Shut up. I'm just not great \Nwith people I've never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.65,0:07:43.15,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yeah, we call that being shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.17,0:07:49.63,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're not the one\N who needs their hand held?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:54.76,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,You are {\i1}so{\i0} not cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.19,0:08:11.14,Flashback,Shikimori/Opponent,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.86,0:08:14.62,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,You can do anything you try, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:15.68,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,Not cute at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.95,0:08:19.18,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Are you... angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.18,0:08:21.89,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,Nah. I'm better than you, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.72,0:08:24.45,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,What? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:25.64,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.72,0:08:28.15,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,Well, keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.19,0:08:33.49,Flashback,Karate Girl1,0,0,0,,Micchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.08,0:08:37.51,Flashback,Karate Girl1,0,0,0,,That was amazing!\N You beat an older student!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:40.20,Flashback,Karate Boy,0,0,0,,And you only just started not long ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.20,0:08:41.79,Flashback,Karate Girl2,0,0,0,,Yeah, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:43.88,Flashback,Karate Girl1,0,0,0,,Hey, would you spar with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:44.95,Flashback,Karate Girl2,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:50.96,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Mom, this is burnt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:53.92,Flashback,Miyabi,0,0,0,,It's fine. It's still just as healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.90,0:09:07.83,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,Starting tomorrow, you'll go \Nto the dojo by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.83,0:09:08.47,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.47,0:09:10.72,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,You can make it on your own now, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.81,0:09:12.64,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.29,0:09:15.62,Flashback,Miyabi,0,0,0,,Once you've finished, wash the dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:16.78,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.77,0:09:19.52,Flashback,Miyabi,0,0,0,,Are you going to continue with karate?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:20.23,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.63,0:09:24.40,Flashback,Miyabi,0,0,0,,It's unusual for you to start \Nsomething new on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.40,0:09:26.00,Flashback,Miyabi,0,0,0,,Fuji must have rubbed off on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:31.85,Flashback,Miyabi,0,0,0,,Once you start something, no matter what it is,\N there are choices you must make.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.85,0:09:33.25,Flashback,Miyabi,0,0,0,,Including if you'll keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:37.21,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.21,0:09:40.50,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I've made friends there, \Nand it makes people happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.95,0:09:41.86,Flashback,Miyabi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.80,0:09:45.14,Flashback,Miyabi,0,0,0,,Then do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:51.53,Flashback,Kayo,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.53,0:09:52.99,Flashback,Girl1 E11,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.99,0:09:54.74,Flashback,Girl1 E11,0,0,0,,You're a boy! Why'd you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:57.42,Flashback,Boy1 E11,0,0,0,,It was her fault for spacing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.78,0:09:59.83,Flashback,Girl1 E11,0,0,0,,You tripped her on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:02.73,Flashback,Boy1 E11,0,0,0,,What? I don't need your false accusations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:06.16,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:07.53,Flashback,Girl1 E11,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.53,0:10:09.42,Flashback,Boy2 E11,0,0,0,,Crap, that's Shikimori!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.97,0:10:12.19,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.24,0:10:16.01,Flashback,Boy1 E11,0,0,0,,Shut up! Stay out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:17.65,Flashback,Boy2 E11,0,0,0,,There's the prince again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.65,0:10:18.88,Flashback,Boy3 E11,0,0,0,,How dashing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:22.16,Flashback,Boy1 E11,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.16,0:10:23.76,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I said stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.69,0:10:28.27,Flashback,Boy1 E11,0,0,0,,Shikimori's scary! C'mon, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.27,0:10:29.77,Flashback,Boy2 E11,0,0,0,,Karate girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.77,0:10:30.91,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.91,0:10:33.02,Flashback,Kayo,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks, Micchan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.22,0:10:35.25,Flashback,Girl1 E11,0,0,0,,Seriously, Micchan, you're so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:38.15,Flashback,Girl2 E11,0,0,0,,Boys are nothing! You can just \Nbeat them up with your karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.63,0:10:41.66,Flashback,Girl1 E11,0,0,0,,Those boys totally have \Na thing for Micchan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:43.08,Flashback,Girl2 E11,0,0,0,,Yeah, for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.08,0:10:45.40,Flashback,Girl1 E11,0,0,0,,{\an8}Boys are just the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:46.90,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I can't deal with boys \Nother than my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.43,0:10:50.23,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I don't get all that "like" stuff at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.11,0:11:23.87,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,You're a real sore loser, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.09,0:11:26.24,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Don't you get upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.60,0:11:29.29,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,Nah. It's not like I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:31.79,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Easy to say when you always win.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.79,0:11:33.62,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,How many times have we had this talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.79,0:11:39.68,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,Hey, that umbrella...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.11,0:11:41.50,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,It's kinda weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.50,0:11:44.15,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Is it? Everybody has one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.15,0:11:45.85,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,No individuality at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.85,0:11:48.06,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Don't judge me over an umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:51.28,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,They're popular,\N so I just thought, "Why not?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.28,0:11:52.26,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.67,0:11:55.52,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,I'm gonna quit karate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:11:56.30,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:11:59.53,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Out of the blue like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.53,0:12:00.78,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,It's not, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.27,0:12:04.91,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But you won that last tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.09,0:12:06.87,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,I found something else I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.73,0:12:16.40,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,What are {\i1}you{\i0} gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:18.32,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.51,0:12:22.46,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,C'mon. Isn't there anything you wanna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.81,0:12:25.51,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,You really have no individuality at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.96,0:12:30.51,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,Don't just try to be like me or Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:35.06,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,Find what it is you really want
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.06,0:12:38.02,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,and make the choice for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.95,0:12:48.45,Flashback,Kayo,0,0,0,,Hey, Micchan...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.08,0:12:51.08,Flashback,Kayo,0,0,0,,Do you read manga?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:53.61,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Hmm... Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.61,0:12:55.15,Flashback,Kayo,0,0,0,,Oh, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.12,0:13:00.88,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I do read some of my brother's sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.19,0:13:02.22,Flashback,Kayo,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:03.04,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.04,0:13:05.85,Flashback,Kayo,0,0,0,,I just found a {\i1}super {\i0}\Ninteresting one recently!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.85,0:13:07.89,Flashback,Kayo,0,0,0,,I'll lend it to you! Read it, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.89,0:13:10.36,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You must really like manga, Kayo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.77,0:13:13.89,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:22.67,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H171F27&\move(543,180.666,543,338.333)}I can't reach it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.13,0:13:24.42,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H171F27&)\pos(580,201.999)}I guess... \N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\NI'm interested \Nin you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.13,0:13:24.42,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H171F27&)\pos(248,131.333)}Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.90,0:13:28.68,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H171F27&\move(550,60,550,139.333)}The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.90,0:13:28.68,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H171F27&\move(88,210,88,287)}I've always\N been watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:32.67,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs14\frz15\shad0\bord0\c&H171F27&\move(517.333,30,517.333,-40)}Hug
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:36.69,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs20\shad0\frz13\bord0\c&H171F27&\move(154.667,398.667,154.667,188.667)}I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.66,0:13:45.24,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Love is... incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:57.80,Flashback,Referee,0,0,0,,Shikimori wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.53,0:14:02.19,Flashback,Karate Girl1,0,0,0,,Congrats on the win!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.19,0:14:05.00,Flashback,Karate Girl2,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're going to nationals!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.00,0:14:07.66,Flashback,Karate Boy,0,0,0,,You really are strong, Shikimori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.66,0:14:08.70,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.72,0:14:15.10,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs18\an8\c&H4C5458&\3c&HF8F7F6&\4c&HF8F7F6&}Kanto Regional Karate Tournament \N{\fs22}36th Annual Boys' & Girls' Championship\N\N{\fs14}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.86,0:14:12.42,Flashback,Karate Girl1,0,0,0,,After winning this tournament, \Nyour future's really promising!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.42,0:14:15.08,Flashback,Karate Girl2,0,0,0,,Yeah! You'll kick butt at nationals, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:19.83,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,No. Once I start high school...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.41,0:14:21.99,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm quitting karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.34,0:14:25.61,Flashback,Karate Kids,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.36,0:14:26.36,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(416.666,129.334)\fnTimes New Roman\fs18\c&HC9C5C3&\3c&H433A33&\shad0\blur2}South\N Gymnasium
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:29.47,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I've found what I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:32.08,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I want to be a cute girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.61,0:14:34.78,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I want to become a cutie
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.78,0:14:38.53,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,and fall in love with a kind, handsome boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.81,0:14:44.15,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I always felt comfortable\Nchasing after Nii-san or Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.09,0:14:48.62,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I never worried about what to wear\N or if my hair was out of place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.45,0:14:51.71,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I just did what they told me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.39,0:14:54.24,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,That was enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.55,0:14:58.79,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:00.25,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Losing weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.86,0:15:05.04,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Maybe the truth is that I don't \Nknow what I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.74,0:15:06.24,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:09.35,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's okay if I'm not the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.88,0:15:13.24,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll {\i0}become{\i1} the me I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:18.54,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H635F6A&\3c&HF6F9F6&\4c&HF6F9F6&\pos(180,27.333)}Entrance Exam Site
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.30,0:15:20.74,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Neat and tidy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:23.13,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I hope my hair stayed put.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.73,0:15:29.93,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.41,0:15:31.79,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.70,0:15:34.35,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.01,0:15:37.48,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,My exam ticket got blown away,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.48,0:15:39.70,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,and now it's stuck in this tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.99,0:15:41.07,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.46,0:15:43.78,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's pretty high up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.39,0:15:48.83,Flashback,Exam Worker,0,0,0,,You're not getting anything down \Nfrom way up there without a ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.30,0:15:51.46,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Is there time to get one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.46,0:15:55.56,Flashback,Exam Worker,0,0,0,,Hmm... In any event, \NI'll go get one. Wait right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.88,0:15:59.05,Flashback,Exam Worker,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.05,0:16:00.60,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.67,0:16:04.84,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.23,0:16:10.47,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I might be able to climb that high.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.47,0:16:11.17,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.17,0:16:12.65,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Please hold this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.65,0:16:14.32,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Uh... Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.37,0:16:18.29,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.28,0:16:23.37,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,If you fall while climbing that, \Nyou could get seriously hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.45,0:16:27.49,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. I'm used \Nto doing things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:30.82,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Still... it's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.48,0:16:33.70,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,So... I'd rather you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.80,0:16:36.51,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wait, were you even listening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:38.63,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Darn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.44,0:16:44.77,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wow, she's already that high up...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.98,0:16:56.03,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:01.79,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:03.21,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.21,0:17:06.04,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I haven't even started \Nhigh school yet and I blew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.83,0:17:10.17,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,U-Um, you're not hurt \Nor anything, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.17,0:17:13.17,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,He must think I'm so unladylike now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.44,0:17:31.65,Flashback,BG Student1,0,0,0,,Hey, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.65,0:17:32.44,Flashback,BG Student2,0,0,0,,Long time no see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.81,0:17:37.76,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:41.67,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're the girl who climbed the tree to get \Nmy exam ticket when the wind caught it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.93,0:17:46.54,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,From when my high school \Ndebut went up in smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.97,0:17:51.93,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-I'm glad you passed the exam\N and got into this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:53.29,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:56.22,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,I've wanted to thank you all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.63,0:17:58.30,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,You really saved me that day!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.05,0:18:00.71,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Really, it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:03.82,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well, um, I'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.51,0:18:08.63,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,He must be so weirded out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:09.93,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:14.94,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,I-I really have the worst luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.89,0:18:18.82,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,If I'd climbed the tree that day, \Na branch would've snapped,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.82,0:18:21.81,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,the fall would've broken my leg,\Nand I never would've gotten in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.61,0:18:24.60,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,I've been unlucky since I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.97,0:18:28.07,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,All I've ever done is cause trouble\Nfor the people around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.17,0:18:33.38,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,So, um... I'm glad you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.93,0:18:39.09,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,And I'm glad I got to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.42,0:18:47.60,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wh-What am I even saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.52,0:18:49.66,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.78,0:18:55.52,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Why is he smiling at me after \NI did something so uncute?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.11,0:19:01.32,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Um, I just wanted to say I'm glad \NI got to thank you in person!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.32,0:19:03.57,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'll go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.24,0:19:07.62,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:11.00,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,I-It's Ijumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.75,0:19:22.18,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,I swear, you're not cute at all.\N You never were.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.18,0:19:23.26,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.46,0:19:25.10,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,So? What'd you buy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:28.27,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,What?! You didn't buy anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.27,0:19:29.79,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,Why'd you even come?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.14,0:19:31.27,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:34.04,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I thought the problem was my clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.04,0:19:36.77,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,but I suddenly get the feeling it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.67,0:19:39.44,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:43.95,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I don't know. I guess it's a \Nproblem with {\i1}me...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.95,0:19:45.96,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,A mental thing, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.96,0:19:47.91,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,Oh, to have it as easy as you do...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:48.78,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.91,0:19:53.44,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,This is what I mean. Normally \Nyou'd stress over what to wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.25,0:19:57.42,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I don't even know why, \Nbut you irk me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.22,0:20:00.27,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll get Mom's advice on what to wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.27,0:20:01.52,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,You baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.52,0:20:03.45,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.39,0:20:08.73,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,How pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.73,0:20:09.88,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But 5,000 yen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:11.89,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,Whatcha lookin' at?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.89,0:20:15.26,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'd love to wear something \Nlike this someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.26,0:20:16.92,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,Are you old enough for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.92,0:20:18.90,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm seventeen now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.97,0:20:23.26,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I feel like I could be stronger if I wore this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.91,0:20:26.48,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You always need courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.13,0:20:28.91,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,Is that how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:30.51,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,Look over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:35.13,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Onii-chan, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.13,0:20:36.03,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,Karate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.79,0:20:38.16,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:43.00,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.31,0:20:53.15,Main,Fuji,0,0,0,,Yeah, I still don't get it. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.15,0:20:53.87,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.55,0:21:00.32,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I went through a lot, \Nbut I finally settled on what to wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.94,0:21:00.98,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\c&H7A9770&\3c&HE1FDD0&\fs14\shad0\an7\pos(368.667,70.667)\frz351.3}What should \NI wear with it
