Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.20,0:21:10.92,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I need to get ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.73,0:21:19.20,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs28\shad0\bord0\c&H444A4C&\frz17\move(272,65.333,272,110)}Good luck
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.16,0:21:22.01,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,This is the one I was looking at!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.92,0:21:25.12,Flashback,Fuji,0,0,0,,I'm gonna hit the restroom. Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.12,0:21:26.62,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.35,0:21:38.35,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:42.47,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll do my best, Nii-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.38,0:21:46.30,Main,Miyabi,0,0,0,,I'll leave your coat here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:47.99,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.79,0:21:50.10,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well, I'm off!
